        <activityName xml:lang="en">Flexible duct, aluminum/PET, DN of 125, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Flexible duct, aluminum/PET, DN of 125, at plant
Production of a typical component used for a ventilation system in a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h.;
UUID: 2e0c5286-81ca-307b-819e-9548c3bda8a8
&lt;null&gt;
Location: Data for production in Germany used.
Technology: Flexible tube made of PET, laminated with aluminium foil and strengthened with galvanised steel spiral wire. Weight 0.205 kg/m
Time period: Materials investigated in 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Questionnaire and technical information of producer. Data of one common product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2e0c5286-81ca-307b-819e-9548c3bda8a8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
